    "layer_3": "out_of_scope",
    "notes": [
      "INFO: CNEL CODE: I022 confirmed from CNEL archivio contratti (www.cnel.it/Contratti-Collettivi) for the Autoferrotranvieri e Internavigatori sector.",
      "INFO: SIGNATORIES: employer side — AGENS (aziende ex gestione governativa), ASSTRA (aziende di trasporto pubblico locale), ANAV (autolinee e autoservizi). Union side — FILT-CGIL, FIT-CISL, Uiltrasporti, Faisa-Cisal, UGL-FNA. Confirmed from AGENS circular 20/03/2025.",
      "INFO: AGREEMENT DATE: 2024-12-11 (intesa preliminare, confirmed in AGENS circular 20/03/2025 as the date that became definitively effective upon scioglimento delle riserve on 20/03/2025). Contract validity: 01/01/2024 to 31/12/2026.",
      "INFO: SALARY MODEL: conglobated (TOTALE). base_salary per level = tabellare (Sep 2023) + contingenza (frozen since 1992) + TDR (Trattamento Distinto della Retribuzione, 51.65 EUR at par.175) + mensa (16.53 EUR/month, in retribuzione normale per Art. 43) + indennita di funzione (72.30 EUR for par.250, 51.65 EUR for par.230, 0 for all others). Sources: UilTrasporti official salary table PDF (March 2025); Thaler 2022 CCNL summary (contingenza and TDR tables).",
      "INFO: SALARY TRANCHES: 3 periods. Period 1 (2024-12-11 to 2025-03-01): Sep 2023 tabellare values. Period 2 (2025-03-01 to 2026-08-01): +60 EUR at par.175, pro-rated. Period 3 (2026-08-01 to null): +100 EUR at par.175 (cumulative +160 EUR at par.175). Confirmed from UilTrasporti table and AGENS circular 20/03/2025.",
      "INFO: HOURLY DIVISOR: 195. Derived from CCNL Art. 15 (primary source, italpaghe.ilccnl.it): 'Gli importi orari si determinano dividendo la retribuzione giornaliera per l'orario medio giornaliero.' Daily = monthly/30; for 39h/week the CCNL Thaler 2022 summary specifies dividing by 6 to get daily hours: 39/6 = 6.5h/day; divisor = 30 * 6.5 = 195. Three independent sources (CCNL Art. 15, lexplain.it, Thaler 2022) confirm the formula. Note: lavoro-economia.it states 'divisore convenzionale 169' but this contradicts the CCNL primary text and two corroborating sources; not adopted.",
      "INFO: ADDITIONAL MONTHS: 14 (tredicesima in December + quattordicesima in June). Confirmed from CCNL Art. 40 (tredicesima) and Art. 41 (quattordicesima). Source: Thaler 2022 CCNL summary.",
      "INFO: SENIORITY: biennale (24 months), maximum 6 scatti. Per-level amounts (EUR/scatto) confirmed from Thaler 2022 CCNL summary table, all 33 parametri. Note: two pairs share the same scatto amount (par.158 = par.160 = 24.65; par.138 = par.139 = 21.06) — this is as published.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: EDR 2024: modelled as fixed_allowances per level, code='edr_2024'. Amount = 40 EUR at par.175, proportional to parametro. Active from 2025-03-01 to 2026-04-30 (14 months). Source: AGENS circular 20/03/2025 — 'elemento distinto della retribuzione, non assorbibile, di importo pari a 40 euro mensili per il parametro 175, proporzionalmente riparametrato per tutti gli altri livelli, per una durata di 14 mensilita.' Per AGENS circular, EDR is 'non computabile ai fini del TFR e della contribuzione al Fondo Priamo.' SIMPLIFICATION: the engine includes fixed_allowances in the TFR base (via gross_monthly * additional_months path). TFR is therefore overstated by ~EDR * 14 months during the active window. This is an existing engine-level simplification documented in compute.py.",
      "INFO: APPRENTICESHIP: CCNL Art. 36-bis (apprendistato professionalizzante). No wage reduction — apprentice earns 100% of destination level from day one. destination_level='100' (entry parametro). Source: Art. 36-bis per AGENS circular 20/03/2025 reference to previgente CCNL provisions on apprendistato.",
      "SIMPLIFICATION: INPS: reuses 2026-terziario.json. The Autoferrotranvieri sector (TPL) includes both public-owned (ex-gestione governativa) and private operators. INPS classification is TERZIARIO for private TPL companies (confirmed by ASSTRA/ANAV membership profile and INPS contribution circulars for the trasporti locali sector). SIMPLIFICATION: some publicly-owned TPL operators may have different INPS contribution schemes; this file models private-sector employers.",
      "INFO: LEVELS: 33 parametri from 100 to 250. The CCNL classification assigns one or more job profiles per parametro; this file models one level per parametro as the economic unit. Descriptions are representative summaries; multiple job profiles exist at each parametro."
    ]
  },
